{"title":"Let's talk about 'political violence'","link":"https://www.usermag.co/p/lets-talk-about-political-violence","date":1757694992000,"content":"<div><figure><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!eJVZ!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F0647cbca-7c00-46f7-8f33-481849538a57_1200x900.webp\"><div><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!eJVZ!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F0647cbca-7c00-46f7-8f33-481849538a57_1200x900.webp\" width=\"524\" height=\"393\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!eJVZ!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F0647cbca-7c00-46f7-8f33-481849538a57_1200x900.webp 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!eJVZ!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F0647cbca-7c00-46f7-8f33-481849538a57_1200x900.webp 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!eJVZ!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F0647cbca-7c00-46f7-8f33-481849538a57_1200x900.webp 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!eJVZ!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F0647cbca-7c00-46f7-8f33-481849538a57_1200x900.webp 1456w\" /><div><div></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p>Since Charlie Kirk was shot on Wednesday, political leaders and liberal pundits have all come out of the woodwork to condemn \"political violence.\"</p><p>\"The murder of Charlie Kirk is part of a disturbing rise in political violence that threatens to hollow out our public life,\" Bernie Sanders <a href=\"https://x.com/SenSanders/status/1966252385908699568\">said on Thursday</a>. \"Political violence has absolutely no place in our nation,\" Nancy Pelosi <a href=\"https://x.com/SpeakerPelosi/status/1965857741312045418\">said</a>. \"Political violence is completely incompatible with American values,\" Hakeem Jeffries <a href=\"https://abcnews.go.com/Politics/trump-vance-lawmakers-react-shooting-charlie-kirk/story?id=125452435\">posted</a>. \"Political violence has no place in America,\" Kamala Harris <a href=\"https://x.com/KamalaHarris/status/1965864889651704135\">echoed</a>.</p>\n      <p>\n          <a href=\"https://www.usermag.co/p/lets-talk-about-political-violence\">\n              Read more\n          </a>\n      </p>","author":"Taylor Lorenz","siteTitle":"usermag.co","siteHash":"95f273abc07d53f60c12a9877d5e701fc5d46103659afbdcd53f0429eec6280d","entryHash":"1122beccd44583305c644c51eb5733d776e6c5720d0bc2c283085042ec313b87","category":"Sites"}